{%- comment -%}
  "Who is behind this" box shown on every article. States who runs the farm and links to the honest "How we write" page. It does not claim the owner wrote or reviewed each post.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="pl-whois page-width">
  <div class="pl-whois__box">
    <p class="pl-whois__kicker">Who is behind this</p>
    <p class="pl-whois__name">Basil Thomas</p>
    <p class="pl-whois__role">Farmer and founder, Pure Leven Spices & Tea</p>
    <p class="pl-whois__bio">Basil runs Pure Leven Spices & Tea from Rajakumary in Idukki, where he grew up watching his father farm black pepper, clove, coffee and tea, and later cardamom. He worked as a cyber security architect until Covid brought him home. Customers kept calling back for the farm's produce, so he carried on, and he now runs it with two staff. Farm chores were how he learned farming as a child, so he knows how to source well and set aside the lower grade.</p>
    <a class="pl-whois__link" href="/pages/how-we-write">How we write these guides</a>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .pl-whois { margin-block: 32px 8px; }
  .pl-whois__box { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #DEDEDB; border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px; max-width: 720px; }
  .pl-whois .pl-whois__kicker { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5F6470 !important; margin: 0 0 10px; }
  .pl-whois .pl-whois__name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #0B0B0F !important; margin: 0; }
  .pl-whois .pl-whois__role { font-size: 14px; color: #5F6470 !important; margin: 2px 0 12px; }
  .pl-whois .pl-whois__bio { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #3D4250 !important; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .pl-whois a.pl-whois__link { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #004438 !important; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
